rule PhpStep/getclass-unpack-start: S ~> S[.TODO = [$at_task((porigin), EVAL expression), GETCLASS_UNPACK_PREP pgetclasscall] ++ ptask_tail*][.RESULT = KNOWN PNULL][.BASE = BASE_VALUE (KNOWN PNULL)]
